  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 1.0.0-beta.3:\n      - Fixed ApplicationCertificate store type (Directory) and ApplicationUri formatting for encrypted connections.\n      - Improved PLC certificate validation compatibility when untrusted certificates are allowed.\n      - Upgraded underlying OPC Foundation .NET Standard stack dependencies to v1.5.378+.\n      - Automatic, permission-safe certificate store resolution for desktop apps, Windows services, and debug sessions with restricted Windows ACLs.\n      - Fully asynchronous API (*Async) with batch support (IEnumerable) for Read, Write, Monitoring, and Address Space Browsing (deprecating legacy sync methods).\n      - Completely decoupled public API (Tag, Group, Device, TagEventArgs) shielding consumer applications from OPCFoundation SDK types.\n      - Added UTC Timestamp and DisplayName resolution on Tag, plus flexible NodeId address support (symbolic string, numeric, and raw ns=... formats).",
